<title>UK: Bayer Hypo sets 1.5 bln Ffr 10-year bond.</title>
<headline>Bayer Hypo sets 1.5 bln Ffr 10-year bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-10-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by joint lead managers BZW and Caisse de Depots et Consignations.</p>
<p> BORROWER   BAYERISCHE HYPOTHEKEN- UND WECHSEL-BANK AG</p>
<p> AMT    1.5 BLN FFR   COUPON     6.125     MATURITY    04.DEC.06</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  101.30    PAY DATE    04.DEC.96</p>
<p> FULL FEES  2.00	REOFFER    99.65     SPREAD	+22 BP</p>
<p> MOODY	AA2	 LISTING    PARIS/LUX PAY FREQ    =</p>
<p> S&amp;P	  A+	  DENOMS (K) 10-100-1M SALE LIMITS US/FR/DE</p>
<p> GOV LAW    ENGLISH   HOME CTRY  GERMANY   TAX PROVS   =</p>
<p> MGT/UND    0.35	SELL CONC  1.65	PRAECIPUUM  =</p>
<p>UNDERLYING GOVT BOND INTERP. 6.5 PCT 2006 AND 8.5 PCT 2008 OAT</p>
<p> NOTES	ISSUED OFF EMTN PROGRAMME</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
